  "iAZH55pwWDzV": {
    "proposition_id": "iAZH55pwWDzV",
    "text": "Gastrulation is a critical phase of embryonic development in which the blastula (a single-layered embryoblast) undergoes a series of complex cellular movements and rearrangements to form the gastrula (a multi-layered embryo)",
